Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:19:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Berrak: bundled httpx extension 0.2.8 (styled pages keep
 their layout)

Rebuilt from xmpp-httpx e2e6627: the extension's reading style (system
font, centred 46rem column) now applies only to pages that bring no
stylesheet of their own, so a real site through a proxy-mode exit is laid
out by its own CSS instead of boxed into that column. The same files as
Berrak 0.x's bundle 0.2.8 (klar-httpx), verified there on GeckoView 125
with xmpp.org through an n146 exit; the change is page-side JavaScript,
covered by xmpp-httpx's Chromium and Firefox browser tests.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ec3g34YeceWefbDxePbgre
